Source: https://docs.z.ai/guides/overview/pricing

|| Model     | Cache hit | Cache miss | Output ||
|| --------- | --------- | ---------- | ------ ||
|| `glm-5.3` | $0.26     | $1.40      | $4.40  ||
|| `glm-4.7` | $0.11     | $0.60      | $2.20  ||

> **GLM Coding Plan billing is points-based**, not per-token. The USD/MTok
